VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# Existing compatible backend URL and browser-safe publishable (or legacy anon) key.
# Alternatively set VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY; it takes precedence over ANON_KEY.
# NEVER use a service-role or secret key in either browser variable.
# Email confirmation/recovery and redirect URLs require owner-side configuration.
# Google currently uses the Nutrio Lovable-managed broker in src/AuthPanel.tsx.
# Its callback is the approved production URL, including from local development.
# A fork needs its own authorized broker/callback setup; see README.md.
# Hosting target: Vercel. See DEPLOYMENT.md.
# Private AI and USDA keys belong in server-side function secrets, never VITE_ variables.
